3.47-3.49 (m, 2H), 2.76-2.82 (m, 1H), 2.63-2.66 (m, 1H), 1.30-1.32 (m,
4H), 0.88 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 138.2, 137.6,
128.4, 127.9, 127.6, 74.9, 73.4, 71.9, 71.5, 71.1. 64.9, 60.4, 49.8,
